OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary intervenes to ban
OL,4,ADrumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant has banned the contentious
OL,8,FOrange Order parade at Drumcree.
OL,10,FThe dispute led to a stand-off between
OL,11,FOrangemen and nationalist residents of
OL,12,Fthe Garvaghy Road in Portadown lasting
OL,13,Falmost two weeks.
OL,15,FSir Chris said the PSNI chief constable
OL,16,Fadvised him "it would not be possible
OL,17,Fto enable the procession to happen
OL,18,Fwithout a major intervention which
OL,19,Fwould carry an unacceptable risk of
OL,20,Fserious injury, disorder and a wider
OL,21,Fcontagion effect across Northern
OL,22,FIreland".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
